# `.claude/` is local agent state, EXCEPT shared skills and user commands:
# Claude Code reads .claude/skills, Codex reads .agents/skills via symlink — one
# committed source. `.claude/commands/` is user-invoked only: loaded when the
# user types the slash command, never advertised to a model as a skill.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/commands/**
!.claude/workflows/
!.claude/workflows/**
docs/superpowers/
/vite-iframe-*.png
/vite-running-in-browser.png

# `build/` (above) is for build OUTPUT, but apps/playground/build/ holds SOURCE
# (sw-plugin.ts, imported by vite.config.ts → in tsconfig include). Without this,
# a fresh checkout is missing the file and playground typecheck/build go red.
!apps/playground/build/
!apps/playground/build/**

# Local Netlify folder
.netlify
